.TH OCCLUVIEW 1 "August 2026" "OccluView" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
occluview \- native viewer and editor for dental 3D meshes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B occluview
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
OccluView opens STL, PLY, OBJ, GLB, and supported HPS mesh files in an
interactive desktop viewport. Additional files passed to a running instance
are added to its current scene.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h , " " \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.TP
.BR \-V , " " \-\-version
Show the installed version.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/share/doc/occluview/
contains usage, license, and third-party attribution documents.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR occluview-cli (1)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/occlutrace/OccluView/issues.
